---
import DocsLayout from '../../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import Callout from '../../../components/Callout';
import CodeBlock from '../../../components/CodeBlock';
import PageNavigation from '../../../components/PageNavigation.astro';

const ollamaCommands = `ollama pull llama3.1
ollama run llama3.1

curl http://localhost:11434/v1/chat/completions \\
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\
  -d '{
    "model": "llama3.1",
    "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "hello" }]
  }'`;

const vllmCommands = `vllm serve meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct \\
  --host 0.0.0.0 \\
  --port 8000

curl http://localhost:8000/v1/chat/completions \\
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\
  -d '{
    "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct",
    "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "hello" }]
  }'`;
---

<DocsLayout
  title="Local LLM"
  description="Ollama와 vLLM을 이용한 로컬/자체 호스팅 LLM 실험"
  currentPath="/map/ai/local-llm"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-8">
    <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-text-secondary mb-6" aria-label="현재 위치">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">홈</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <a href="/map/ai" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">AI 빌더</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span class="text-primary font-medium">Local LLM</span>
    </nav>

    <header class="mb-8 pb-6 border-b border-border">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary text-xs font-bold mb-4">
        Lv.4 · Inference
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-white mb-4">Local LLM</h1>
      <p class="text-text-secondary text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Local LLM은 비용, 보안, 오프라인, 실험 속도 때문에 선택합니다.
        처음은 Ollama로 빠르게 확인하고, GPU 서버에서 처리량이 필요하면 vLLM을 비교합니다.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <Callout client:load variant="warning" title="먼저 정할 것">
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm">
          모델을 띄우기 전에 “어떤 기능의 어떤 품질 기준을 통과해야 하는가”를 정하세요. 하네스 없이 로컬 모델만 바꾸면 판단이 흐려집니다.
        </p>
      </Callout>
    </section>

    <article class="prose prose-invert max-w-none">
      <section class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Ollama 빠른 실험</h2>
        <CodeBlock client:load filename="terminal" code={ollamaCommands} />
      </section>

      <section class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">vLLM 서버 실험</h2>
        <CodeBlock client:load filename="terminal" code={vllmCommands} />
      </section>

      <section class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">선택 기준</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="p-4 bg-surface border border-border rounded-xl">
            <h3 class="text-white font-bold mb-1">Ollama</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">개인 개발, 빠른 모델 교체, Mac/로컬 실험에 좋습니다.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-surface border border-border rounded-xl">
            <h3 class="text-white font-bold mb-1">vLLM</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">GPU 서버, OpenAI 호환 서버, 동시 요청 처리량 비교에 좋습니다.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-surface border border-border rounded-xl">
            <h3 class="text-white font-bold mb-1">Hosted API</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">최신 모델 품질, 운영 안정성, 빠른 제품 검증에 유리합니다.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-surface border border-border rounded-xl">
            <h3 class="text-white font-bold mb-1">Gateway</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">여러 모델을 base URL과 라우팅 정책으로 교체할 때 필요합니다.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </article>

    <section class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-border">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-4">다음 액션</h3>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/recipes/run-local-llm" class="p-4 bg-surface border border-border rounded-lg hover:border-primary/50 transition-colors no-underline">
          <h4 class="text-white font-medium mb-1">Local LLM 레시피</h4>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Ollama/vLLM 실험 프롬프트 생성</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/map/ai/harness" class="p-4 bg-surface border border-border rounded-lg hover:border-primary/50 transition-colors no-underline">
          <h4 class="text-white font-medium mb-1">AI 하네스</h4>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">모델 전환 전후 품질 비교</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <PageNavigation currentPath="/map/ai/local-llm" />
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
